+   // CarbonGlobe: ED_FIRE_X_FILE = one ignition factor per window year (the mean of (DI / 30000)^10 the organisers'
+   // fire saw in that year, computed outside); rate = site fuel x fp1 x X[year], capped below. The burn of step
+   // t = 12 (2 + k) lands between the December snapshots k and k + 1 of the window (snapshot 0 = t 12).
+   static std::vector<double> cg_x; static bool cg_x_loaded = false;
